### ==============================================================================
### HadirKu REST API Client Testing
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Root & Health Check Endpoints
# Root API Banner
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Health Check (Koneksi Database & Server Status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### ==============================================================================
### 2. Autentikasi & Login (JWT Generation)
### ==============================================================================

### Login Admin HR (Ahmad Fauzi)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/karyawan/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmad.fauzi@hadirku.id",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Login Karyawan (Alexsander Jajang)
# @name loginKaryawan
POST {{baseUrl}}/karyawan/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alexjajang@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "karyawan"
}

### Variabel Token dari Hasil Login di atas
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
@userToken = {{loginKaryawan.response.body.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### 3. Karyawan Endpoints (CRUD)
### ==============================================================================

### Ambil Semua Karyawan (Memerlukan Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/karyawan
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Ambil Karyawan By ID (ID: 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/karyawan/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Tambah Karyawan Baru (Khusus Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/karyawan
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Rian Pratama",
  "email": "rian.pratama@hadirku.id",
  "password": "password123",
  "posisi": "Frontend Developer",
  "avatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?w=150",
  "role": "karyawan"
}

### Update Data Karyawan (ID: 1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/karyawan/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Alexsander Jajang",
  "email": "alexjajang@gmail.com",
  "posisi": "Senior Software Engineer",
  "avatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=150",
  "role": "karyawan"
}


### ==============================================================================
### 4. Absensi Endpoints
### ==============================================================================

### Statistik Presensi Admin Dashboard (Khusus Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/absensi/statistik
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Semua Log Presensi Karyawan
GET {{baseUrl}}/absensi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Daftar Presensi Hari Ini
GET {{baseUrl}}/absensi/hari-ini
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Status Presensi Hari Ini untuk Karyawan ID 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/absensi/status-hari-ini/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Riwayat Absensi Karyawan ID 1 (14 Hari Terakhir)
GET {{baseUrl}}/absensi/riwayat/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Absen Masuk (Clock In)
POST {{baseUrl}}/absensi/masuk
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "karyawan_id": 1,
  "lokasi_masuk": "Dalam Radius Kantor (Graha Pratama Lt. 8)",
  "catatan": "Hadir tepat waktu"
}

### Absen Pulang (Clock Out)
POST {{baseUrl}}/absensi/pulang
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "karyawan_id": 1,
  "lokasi_pulang": "Dalam Radius Kantor (Graha Pratama Lt. 8)",
  "catatan": "Shift selesai tuntas"
}


### ==============================================================================
### 5. Izin / Cuti Endpoints
### ==============================================================================

### Ambil Semua Pengajuan Izin (Khusus Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/izin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Ambil Riwayat Izin per Karyawan (ID: 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/izin/karyawan/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Ajukan Izin / Cuti Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/izin
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "karyawan_id": 1,
  "tanggal_mulai": "2026-09-25",
  "tanggal_selesai": "2026-09-26",
  "tipe": "Cuti Tahunan",
  "alasan": "Keperluan keluarga di luar kota"
}

### Update Status Izin oleh HR (Disetujui / Ditolak - ID: 1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/izin/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Disetujui"
}
